Package: pleasantry
Title: Generate Randomized Compliments and Farewells
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Amelia", "Miramonti", , "amiramonti@nebraska.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0277-4064"))
Description: Generates randomized compliments and farewells by combining
    templates with random adjectives and subjects, with controls for mood,
    weirdness, profanity, and pseudo-Shakespearean phrasing. Useful for
    adding a bit of positivity (or hostility, or iambic flair) to scripts,
    apps, or console output.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://amelia-m.github.io/pleasantry/
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Imports: 
    cli
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
